super-log (0.3.0-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial PPA packaging: the hub daemon (superlogd) as a systemd service,
    the C/C++ SDK headers, and the zero-dependency tailers as commands.
  * FIX session logs (superlog-fix) and MAVLink drone telemetry
    (superlog-mavlink).
  * ts-moveables and the fmt/spdlog/json submodules are vendored into the
    source tarball so the build fetches nothing - as a Launchpad builder
    requires.

